Verify Env After RAT Reset And Wait For Affected Components
    [Documentation]    Verifies CELLs, BBMODs, RMODs and RATs state after RAT reset
    [Arguments]        ${env_vrf}
    ...                ${connection_alias}
    ...                ${timeout}=600

    Check If Components Are In Expected State After RAT Reset
    ...                                   env_vrf=${env_vrf}
    ...                                   connection_alias=${connection_alias}
    Robot Log Operation   Start monitoring unaffected components for status changes and affected components for recovery

    ${start_time}=                       Get Time    epoch
    FOR    ${index}    IN RANGE          1    1000000

        Check Not Affected Components    ${env_vrf}    ${connection_alias}

        ${affected_status}=              Run keyword and return status
        ...                              Check Affected Components If Online
        ...                              env_vrf=${env_vrf}
        ...                              connection_alias=${connection_alias}
        Run keyword if                   ${affected_status} == ${True}    Exit For Loop

        ${current_time}                  Get Time    epoch
        ${elapsed_time}                  Evaluate    ${current_time} - ${start_time}
        Run Keyword If                   ${elapsed_time} >= ${timeout}
        ...                              Fail    Timeout while waiting for components to recover.
        Sleep    5s
    END
    Robot Log Operation     All affected components are back online after RAT reset


Check If Components Are In Expected State After RAT Reset
    [Documentation]    Check if affected and not affected components are in expected state after RAT reset
    [Arguments]        ${env_vrf}
    ...                ${connection_alias}

    Check Affected Components            ${env_vrf}    ${connection_alias}
    Check Not Affected Components        ${env_vrf}    ${connection_alias}
    Robot Log Operation                  All components are in expected state after RAT reset


Check Affected Components
    [Documentation]    Check statuses of affected components
    [Arguments]        ${env_vrf}
    ...                ${connection_alias}

    Robot Log Operation    Waiting for RAT reset ...
    wait until keyword succeeds   2m    4s
    ...    status_check.verify_statuses_of_rats
    ...                                         rats=${env_vrf.get_affected_rat_with_variant()}
    ...                                         connection=${connection_alias}
    Robot Log Operation    RAT reset performed.

    wait until keyword succeeds   2m    4s
    ...    status_check.verify_specific_variants_for_specific_bbmods
    ...                                        bbmods_ids_with_variants=${env_vrf.get_affected_bbmod_ids_with_variant()}
    ...                                        connection=${connection_alias}
    wait until keyword succeeds   2m    4s
    ...    status_check.verify_statuses_of_rmods
    ...                                        rmod_ids=${env_vrf.get_affected_rmod_ids()}
    ...                                        status_variant=disabled
    ...                                        connection=${connection_alias}
    wait until keyword succeeds   2m    4s
    ...    status_check.verify_specific_variants_for_specific_cells
    ...                                        cell_ids_types_variants=${env_vrf.get_affected_cells_with_variant()}
    ...                                        connection=${connection_alias}


Check Not Affected Components
