Stop Background L3 Call And Unblock All Cells
    [Documentation]    Stop background L3 call, unblock all cells and wait for onAir
    [Arguments]        ${bg_l3call_cell}
    ...                ${connection}

    call_manager.Stop Background L3 Call and Verify Results
